*Status:* _Released_ | _WIP_

_The Blue Break_ is a simple surfing game that I originally made for a 7 day game jam. The gameplay is very basic, but I'm proud of the presentation.

#html.video(controls: true, width: 1280, height: 720, src: "/the-blue-break-video.mp4")

Since the jam ended, I've made great improvements to the engine, implementing various graphical effects, and adding rigid body physics.

#html.video(controls: true, width: 1280, height: 720, src: "/the-blue-break-video-2.mp4")

I'm currently working on separating the engine from the game, so I can reuse it for my other games.

